<title>USA: Oneok Inc Q1 shr rises to $0.44.</title>
<headline>Oneok Inc Q1 shr rises to $0.44.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oneok Inc reported results for its fiscal first quarter ended November 30.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.44		    $0.31</p>
<p> Net		 12,174		   8,423</p>
<p> Revenues	   248,752			238,460</p>
<p> Shr outstanding  27,305,000		   27,023,000</p>
<p>NOTE: All data above in 000s except per share data.</p>
<p>The company said its nonregulated business earned $0.24 a share, compared with $0.08 a year ago, and its regulated business earned $0.20 a share, compared with $0.23 a share a year ago.</p>
</text>
